A local declared and never mentioned again, and a parameter never read,
are unused (diag.unused_variable, hint severity, strict profile only).
The write-only local nStage counts as used: dead stores are out of scope.
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE StageBatch;
	:PARAMETERS sBatchId, nPriority;
	:DECLARE nStage, sLeftover;
	nStage := 1;
	:RETURN sBatchId;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
